ating margin."</blockquote><a class="src" href="https://s205.q4cdn.com/626266368/files/doc_financials/2026/q4/Transcript-Salesforce-Inc-Q4-FY26-Earnings-Conference-Call-2-25-26.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://s205.q4cdn.com/626266368/files/doc_financials/2026/q4/Transcript-Salesforce-Inc-Q4-FY26-Earnings-Conference-Call-2-25-26.pdf</a></div></div>
